      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Get celebrated online! In one easy step, publish a Medium.com article. Have something to show people and share publicly that has images and videos and talks about your product. If you don’t have a landing-page, a Medium post can serve as in intro to what you built, and if you do have a landing-page, then a Medium post can serve as marketing to draw visitors.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
